# basePath Chapter3

:: FirstContractOpenCh3
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      Okey-dokey Captain. 
{@PAL}      Now, you're going to be working with Diodes! 
{@Player}   ...
{@PAL}      Now, diodes can enforce unidirectional current flow and they-
{@Player}   ... 
{@PAL}      Uh... Captain? 
{@Player}   Huh? 
{@PAL}      I'm talking about the diodes capacity to attenuate high signals and you seem...
{@PAL}      Unenthused. 
{@Player}   Sorry, P.A.L., my mind was somewhere else. 
{@PAL}      Perhaps, it has something to do with your call with your former crew-mate?
{@Player}   Doesn't matter, let's just do the contract. 
{@PAL}      Sounds good Captain! 

//endregion

::AfterResearchCh3
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene
@once 

{@Joel}     Quinnie, how do I turn this thing on? 
{@Quinn}    It's on Uncle Joel. And don't call me that. 
{@Joel}     Awe Quinnie, don't be embarassed, you loved that name as a kiddo.
{@Player}   Uh- PAL, whose that?
{@PAL}      It's your gift, from me to you! You have a new hauler!
{@Quinn}    I love that the bot takes all the credit. 
{@Quinn}    PAL practically begged me, so, you're welcome I guess. 
{@Joel}     Now, Quinnie, remember, respect the Captain.
{@Quinn}    Right. Sorry Cap'. 
{@Joel}     Pleasure to be of service Captain, let's get to haulin'!
{@Player}   Glad to have you on board. 

::AfterDesignCh3
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      Hey Captain, looks like there's a new supplier available! I'll patch him through. 
{@Xavier}   ... 
{@Player}   Uh... hi. 
{@Xavier}   Hello. 
{@Player}   So... are you the supplier or-- 
{@Xavier}   Of course I'm the supplier. Isn't that obvious? 
{@Xavier}   I sent a memo. Detes are in there. 
{@Player}   A... wha- 
{@Xavier}   Oh Dear Sol. I'm Xavier. Supplier contact for the Ralston sector.
{@Xavier}   Planet of Gold and Golden Opportunities. 
{@Xavier}   Any and all materials within this sector goes through me. Capiche? 
{@Xavier}   Now. Let's talk business. You need material. I have it. You let me know what you want, it's done. 
{@Player}   Uh... well... I'll let you know. 
{@Xavier}   Hmph. Fine. Call me back when you grow a brain and are ready to beat that debt. 

//endregion 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh3
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Callie}   A'hoy! I see a Frontier ship is interested in business... how scandalous. 
{@Player}   Uh... you're the one who called me. 
{@Callie}   Oh... regardless, be blessed in my presence mere corpo-lackey! Or as I like to call ye, Clackey!
{@Callie}  	For it is, I, Callie Lee!
{@Callie}  	The Boron Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station! 
{@Player}  	Is... is that supposed to mean something? 
{@Callie}   Seriously? You... you've never heard of me? 
{@Callie}   The great revolt of the Velos Penal Station...
{@Player}   ... I haven't left the ship in a while. 
{@Callie}   I see… well it should be known that all Frontier ships are marked for pillaging!
{@Callie}   However, if you do continued business with us... 
{@Callie}   We may... avert our attention elsewhere. 
{@Player}   That sounds illegal.
{@Callie}   Illegal schmegal, sometimes bending rules is the only rules you can follow. 
{@Callie}   Holler if you need some goods, Clackey. 
{@Player}  	Don't call me that- aaaand she hung up. 

::AfterFabrication
@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once 

{@PAL}      Looks like this contract was a piece of cake!
{@Player} 	You don’t even know what cake tastes like. 
{@PAL} 	    According to my human empathy algorithm cake tastes…
{@PAL}      10011000  10101000 10110000 !
{@Player} 	…right. 	


